# Tailwind + UI

- This repo uses **Tailwind v4** (`@import "tailwindcss"`, `@theme`, `@plugin` in CSS). There is **no** `tailwind.config.ts` — do not recreate one.
- Theme tokens live in `src/app/globals.css` (`@theme` + CSS variables). Prefer existing tokens (`background`, `foreground`, `primary`, …) over one-off colors.
- PostCSS uses `@tailwindcss/postcss` (`postcss.config.mjs`). Animation via `@plugin "tailwindcss-animate"`.
- Use `cn()` from `~/app/_utils/cn` (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for conditional classes.
- shadcn/ui lives in `src/app/_components/ui/`. `components.json` has `"tailwind.config": ""` and points CSS at `src/app/globals.css`.
- Dark mode uses `@custom-variant dark` and is forced on `<html className="dark">`. Keep new UI consistent with that.
- Prefer utility classes already used nearby. Avoid new design-system abstractions unless necessary.

Canonical: `src/app/globals.css`, `src/app/_utils/cn.ts`, `src/app/_components/ui/dropdown-menu.tsx`, `components.json`, `postcss.config.mjs`
